          <object id="deeds-mod-rule" label="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt; (CLAUDE.md). Lock order, QR deed: reporter_month → scan row → same_act → deed rows. Invite create: reporter_month → invites. Accept: reporter_month (reporter read unlocked first) → invite row → shared_device → pending deed row → same_act. Withdraw: invite row → same_act → deed row. Responses and event payloads never hold coordinates, phone numbers or free text, and never name a pending deed's doer. Non-owners get 404." status="implemented" milestone="M2" source="CLAUDE.md; backend/app/modules/deeds/_edits.py; backend/app/modules/deeds/_invites.py; backend/app/modules/deeds/_qr_deeds.py; backend/app/modules/deeds/_reporter_limit.py"><mxCell style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;rounded=0;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="765" width="1140" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
